name: Flower Pot — four-suit X3
author: corpus
description: >-
  Flower Pot gives X3 Mult if the played hand contains a Diamond, Club, Heart, and
  Spade. First-shop X3 engine: Smeared Joker makes it easier; four-card hands with
  Four Fingers help.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: FlowerPot
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: FourFingers
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 30
  - joker: Splash
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
